! The agent's screen (agentd.js starts fluxbox with -rc on this file, as the screen's owner, the browser uid). Root's and read-only in the image.
! No toolbar, one workspace, no desktop menu and no key that starts a program: the only launchers on the screen are the agent's own dock (agentd-dock.py).
! The wallpaper is set by agentd (ImageMagick on the root window); the overlay keeps fluxbox from setting one of its own.
